title: Direct bill: commission debit note to the insurer
participant F "Finance maker"
participant K "Finance checker"
participant R "Remittance module (direct bill)"
participant D "PostgreSQL"
participant I "Insurer"
F -> R: set policy billing mode to direct (at issue or later; premium bill cancelled and booking reversed)
R -> D: direct_bill_items; JV Dr commission receivable / Cr commission income / Cr output VAT (12%)
F -> R: raise debit note DN- for an insurer and period from unbilled items
F -> R: submit for approval
K -> R: approve (maker-checker) -> Open
R -> I: send debit note (e-mail via outbox)
I --> F: payment: cash + creditable EWT (10%, BIR Form 2307)
F -> R: record collection DNC-: cash, EWT, reference
R -> D: JV Dr cash + Dr creditable WHT / Cr commission receivable; status Partially Collected / Collected
